      "closed_at": "2023-03-08T08:25:23Z",
      "body": "We have logic for if a line crosses a polygon.\r\n\r\nBut, in that logic we do not account for the asset travelling along the line (like we do for line-point and line-line).\r\n\r\nThis will go into `linePolyContact`\r\n\r\nThe failure of this is shown when comparing this interaction: ` Blue-24//Order item 24//Route out Red-9//Order item 9//EW Area of Effect`.  Since the overlap is right at the end of the line, and the line doesn't cross the poly at that point, there should not be an interaction.",
      "labels": [
        "4p9"
      ],
